# Project specific
# Embedding index cache — regenerable via build_restaurant_index(force=True)
app/data/*.npy

# Phase 8 fine-tuning artifacts — all regenerable, none belong in git.
# Anchored (leading /) on purpose: an unanchored `data/` would also match
# app/data/, which holds the tracked restaurant seed JSON — the same trap the
# /lib/ entry above documents.
#   /data/     generated training JSONL + manifest (~25 MB, 0.3s to rebuild)
#   /adapters/ trained LoRA + checkpoints (the only expensive artifact — back
#              it up outside git; see docs/FINE_TUNING.md)
#   /gguf/     merged + quantised model (>1 GB; GitHub rejects >100 MB files)
/data/
/adapters/
/gguf/
*.log
*.sqlite3
*.db
.coverage
htmlcov/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/

